# Abaqus FEA Model Exports

This folder contains **Abaqus-format FEA models** for ATA 53-00-04 (Design).

## Naming convention

Files MUST follow:

`53-00-04-ANLS-02x_RevX_*`

- `53-00-04` – ATA / design section identifier.
- `ANLS` – Analysis artifact.
- `02x` – FEA model code **(see mapping below)**.
- `RevX` – Model revision (e.g. `RevA`, `RevB`, or `Rev01`).
- `*` – Suffix describing content and/or format (e.g. `_Model.inp`, `_BC.inp`, `_Materials.inp`).

### Example

- `53-00-04-ANLS-020_RevA_Model.inp`
- `53-00-04-ANLS-020_RevA_BC.inp`
- `53-00-04-ANLS-021_RevB_Model.inp`

## 02x Code Mapping (example – adapt to your convention)

- `020` – Global fuselage FEA model.
- `021` – Door surround local model.
- `022` – Frame + skin local model.

Extend this list as needed and keep it in sync with your overall analysis coding scheme.

## Recommended file set per FEA model

For each `02x` and revision `RevX`, the recommended Abaqus files are:

- Primary model:
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-02x_RevX_Model.inp`
- Optional:
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-02x_RevX_Materials.inp`
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-02x_RevX_BC.inp`
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-02x_RevX_Output.inp`
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-02x_RevX_Solution.odb` *(if tracked under Git LFS or referenced here)*

The **input decks** (`.inp`) are the authoritative, version-controlled artifacts in this folder.
